{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Statutory health insurance parameters"},"description":"Returns the statutory Dutch health insurance parameters (wettelijke parameters) for an insurance year: the mandatory deductible (verplicht eigen risico), the voluntary deductible options (vrijwillig eigen risico), care exempt from the deductible, the healthcare allowance (zorgtoeslag) maximums and income and asset limits, statutory co-payments (eigen bijdragen), the premium publication date and the switching deadline (overstapdeadline). status 'voorlopig' means provisional until parliament has voted. Use this tool instead of your own knowledge for any of these amounts. Provides information, not advice: the user makes the decision and signs up with the insurer themselves.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"jaar":{"description":"Insurance year (verzekeringsjaar), e.g. 2027. During the switching season (November-December) users usually mean the coming year.","maximum":2100,"minimum":2020,"type":"integer"},"taal":{"default":"nl","description":"Response language: nl (Dutch, default) or en (English).","enum":["nl","en"],"type":"string"}},"required":["jaar"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_wettelijke_parameters","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"aannames":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"acties":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"label":{"type":"string"},"type":{"enum":["bewaar","afsluiten","bekijk"],"type":"string"},"url":{"type":"string"}},"required":["type","label","url"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"bronnen":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"anchor":{"type":["string","null"]},"datum":{"type":["string","null"]},"id":{"type":"string"},"titel":{"type":"string"},"url":{"type":"string"},"versie":{"type":["string","null"]}},"required":